{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__headless-json#card-zh","repo":"JohnXu22786/headless-json","commit":"a914857817b94b55fd62a0e28a7ef071746c25f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-headless-json 是面向 DSH 的 CI 会话报告插件，同时提供独立命令行工具。它通过订阅 session 生命周期事件捕获轮次、步骤、模型消息和工具调用，并在会话结束时生成结构化 JSON 与 JUnit XML，也可实时追加 NDJSON 事件流。报告包含结果类别、退出码、统计和引用文件清单；工具可查询当前捕获状态、筛选事件并调整输出与脱敏选项。适合希望把 DSH 运行接入持续集成、测试报告或离线分析流程的开发者。需 Node.js 18 以上；默认把产物写入当前目录的 dsh-output。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/manager.ts:67-96"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__headless-json#card-en","repo":"JohnXu22786/headless-json","commit":"a914857817b94b55fd62a0e28a7ef071746c25f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-headless-json is a DSH CI plugin and CLI. It captures session events and creates JSON and JUnit reports, plus optional live NDJSON. Reports show outcomes, statistics, and file references; runtime tools provide status, event queries, and settings. Requires Node.js 18+; output goes to dsh-output.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/manager.ts:67-96"]}
